#: es/datatable-faq.Rmd.tmp:block 234 (paragraph)
msgid ""
"Please see the [support "
"guide](https://github.com/Rdatatable/data.table/wiki/Support) on the "
"project's homepage which contains up-to-date links."
msgstr ""
"Consulte la [guía de "
"soporte](https://github.com/Rdatatable/data.table/wiki/Support) en la página "
