#: es/datatable-faq.Rmd.tmp:block 237 (header)
msgid ""
"I'd prefer not to post on the Issues page, can I mail just one or two people"
" privately?"
msgstr ""
"Preferiría no publicar en la página de Problemas, ¿puedo enviar un correo "
"electrónico privado a una o dos personas?"

#: es/datatable-faq.Rmd.tmp:block 238 (paragraph)
msgid ""
"Sure. You're more likely to get a faster answer from the Issues page or "
"Stack Overflow, though. Further, asking publicly in those places helps build"
